# Ansible-generated, host-specific secrets (GlitchTip SECRET_KEY / Postgres
# password). The `password` lookup persists these to disk on the controller
# so they're stable across re-runs; they must never be committed. Everything
# else this project delivers as a secret is age-encrypted first (secrets.age,
# backup-secrets.age, ...), which is safe to commit. These are the one
# exception, generated fresh per deployment rather than checked in ciphertext.
deploy/ansible/credentials/